<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Dhoom Again</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Pritam, Vishal Dadlani, Dominique Cerejo, Asif Ali Baig</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Dhoom:2</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5IUP91X8fKfJnWQgCHT9dN</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.140" end="01:16.920">धूम again and run away with me on a roller coaster ride</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.920" end="01:21.710">धूम again and see your wildest dreams slowly come alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.710" end="01:26.460">धूम again, we gotta break the rules and party all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.460" end="01:30.960">धूम again, we gotta steal the show you know that ain't no crime</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.960" end="01:35.650">So, steal all that you can, the magic you began</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.650" end="01:38.110">Let's shout, break out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.110" end="01:40.870">Come on, once again, let's hear it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.870" end="01:43.220">धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.220" end="01:45.790">Once more, come on you people</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.790" end="01:48.030">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.030" end="01:50.520">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.520" end="01:55.270">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले, धूम</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.270" end="01:57.790">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.790" end="02:00.000">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.000" end="02:03.460">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले, धूम</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.460" end="02:11.460" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.810" end="02:18.120">Let's get freaky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.120" end="02:20.430">Shout your secrets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.430" end="02:22.500">Keep up the spirit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.500" end="02:25.390">Let it go, let it go, yo!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.390" end="02:27.860">Let's get freaky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.860" end="02:30.060">Shout your secrets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.060" end="02:32.140">Keep up the spirit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.140" end="02:33.710">Let it go, let it go, yo!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.710" end="02:38.570">धूम again and feel the beat of the rythm, rythm of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.570" end="02:43.210">धूम again and hear the voices calling creatures of the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.210" end="02:48.020">धूम again and see the shadows dancin' in the pale moonlight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.020" end="02:52.540">धूम again and feel your heartbeat pumpin', now the time is right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.540" end="02:54.940">So go walk out the door</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.940" end="02:57.310">Get down, get on the floor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.310" end="02:59.750">Let's shout, break out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.750" end="03:02.580">Come on, once again let's hear it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.580" end="03:04.930">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.930" end="03:07.260">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.260" end="03:12.050">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले, धूम (धूम-धूम, धूम once again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.050" end="03:14.590">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.590" end="03:16.920">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.920" end="03:21.780">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले, धूम (धू-धू-धूम c'mon everybody shout)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.780" end="03:29.780" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.460" end="03:33.970">And when love comes your way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.970" end="03:36.450">You'll know it's here to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:36.450" end="03:41.260">You'll steal the chance 'cause you're the thief of hearts, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.260" end="03:46.500">You'll win with just a glance, walk away with your romance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:46.500" end="03:49.890">There's no more, there's no backin' out now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:49.890" end="03:57.890" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:58.970" end="04:02.630">(धूम-धूम) let's get freaky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:02.630" end="04:04.800">Shout your secrets (धूम-धूम)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:04.800" end="04:06.970">Keep up the spirit (धूम-धूम)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:06.970" end="04:08.470">Let it go, let it go, yo!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:08.450" end="04:10.820">धूम again and make the whole world crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:10.820" end="04:13.200">Set your spirit free (set your spirit free)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:13.200" end="04:15.450">धूम again and take a break right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:15.450" end="04:18.010">Come celebrate with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:18.010" end="04:22.870">धूम again 'cause all I wanna do is steal the show somehow (somehow)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:22.870" end="04:27.210">धूम again 'cause all I wanna say is hey the time is now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:27.210" end="04:29.760">Let nothing getcha down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:29.760" end="04:32.090">Go out and paint the town (c'mon now)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:32.090" end="04:34.590">Let's shout (uh-huh), break out (let's go)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:34.590" end="04:37.270">Come on, once again, let's here it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:37.270" end="04:39.700">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:39.700" end="04:42.030">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:42.030" end="04:46.810">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले, धूम (धूम-धूम, धूम once again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:46.810" end="04:49.310">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:49.310" end="04:51.680">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:51.680" end="04:56.400">धूम मचा ले, धूम मचा ले, धूम (धू-धू-धूम c'mon once again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:56.400" end="04:58.950">धूम मचा ले</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:58.950" end="05:02.950" /></div></body></tt>